# The automap: open, follow off, the grid, a pan and a zoom while their
# keys are held, the whole map and back, two marks and their clearing,
# the cheat of the map twice, follow on with the player walking, closed
# and open again, and a new level by a cheat with the map open (the
# engine closes it), then open in E1M2. The level starts at frame 41,
# after the wipe of the warp.
50  press tab           # open
54  shot open.ppm
60  press f             # follow off
64  press g             # the grid
68  shot grid.ppm
70  down right          # pan, while held
80  up right
82  shot pan.ppm
90  down minus          # zoom out, while held
100 up minus
102 shot zoomout.ppm
110 down equals         # zoom in
115 up equals
120 press 0             # the whole map
124 shot big.ppm
126 press 0             # back
130 press m             # a mark
132 down up
140 up up
142 press m             # another
146 shot marks.ppm
150 press c             # cleared
160 press i
162 press d
164 press d
166 press t             # all the lines
170 shot iddt1.ppm
180 press i
182 press d
184 press d
186 press t             # and the things
190 shot iddt2.ppm
200 press f             # follow on
202 down up             # the player walks; the map follows
230 up up
232 shot follow.ppm
240 press tab           # closed
244 shot closed.ppm
250 press tab           # open again
254 shot reopened.ppm
260 press i
262 press d
264 press c
266 press l
268 press e
270 press v
272 press 1
274 press 2             # E1M2: the engine closes the map
300 shot e1m2.ppm
330 press tab           # open, in E1M2
334 shot e1m2map.ppm
360 quit
